Hi {Owner},

I build websites for tint, PPF and wrap shops around {City}. {Business Name} has strong film and wrap work on Instagram, but no site where a buyer can price their vehicle or book.

Rather than ask for your time, I built a sample first: tint prices by vehicle, a PPF coverage map from partial front to full body, a wrap gallery sorted by finish and a plain page on the state tint law, with marked placeholders where your photos would go:

{demo-link}

If you want it, I move it to a domain you own and finish it for {Build Range}, plus {Care Range} a month for hosting and changes. If not, no problem, it comes down at the end of the month.

Worth ten minutes on the phone this week?

{Your Name}
{Your Studio} · {Your Phone}
{Your Physical Address}

